<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 10.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 10.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Wednesday</p>
<p>set the following currency fixings for July 10. The litas is</p>
<p>pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   10.07.97	  09.07.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.7518	    6.7380</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.2741	    2.2810</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.4782	    4.4890</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.5439	    3.5414</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5161	    0.5153</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7663	    0.7663</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2843	    0.2851</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0200	    7.0182</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6922	    0.6909</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2107	    1.2130</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
